<https://chalkline.chelseakr.com/ctdl/resources/ce-29fb14ea-266c-435f-ae50-0d9aaca05831>
    a ceterms:License ;
    ceterms:ctid "ce-29fb14ea-266c-435f-ae50-0d9aaca05831" ;
    ceterms:description "California has a two-tier structure for this credential that consists of a sequence of requirements, which the holder is given up to two years to complete. The two-year preliminary credential is the first document issued after an individual meets the specific credential requirements. Individuals receiving the preliminary credential are making a commitment to complete the process and obtain the clear credential. The clear credential is issued once all credential requirements have been completed. If requirements for the clear credential are not completed before the expiration of the preliminary, the holder will be unable to serve in California’s public schools with that credential until those requirements are met and the document renewed.\nThe Speech-Language Pathology Services Credential may be issued in any of the following areas:\nLanguage, Speech and Hearing\nLanguage, Speech and Hearing and Audiology\nLanguage, Speech and Hearing including Special Class Authorization\nLanguage, Speech and Hearing and Audiology including Special Class Authorization\nThe Speech-Language Pathology Services Credential in Language, Speech and Hearing authorizes the holder to conduct Language, Speech, and Hearing Assessments and provide Educational Services, provide specific learning disability area services related to speech and language, and special education services to individuals with language and speech impairments across the special education disability areas, to students from birth through age 22 in services across the continuum of program options available found in California Code of Regulations Title 5 Section 80048.9.3 (see Terms and Definitions)."@en-us ;
    ceterms:identifier _:c14n1136,
        _:c14n250 ;
    ceterms:inLanguage "en-US"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#language> ;
    ceterms:name "Speech Language Pathology Services Credential"@en-us ;
    ceterms:ownedBy <https://chalkline.chelseakr.com/ctdl/resources/ce-58d1aa00-cd57-4d91-9639-49bc92c5e96e> ;
    ceterms:regulatedIn _:c14n714 ;
    ceterms:requires _:c14n1289,
        _:c14n25,
        _:c14n267,
        _:c14n278 ;
    ceterms:subject _:c14n120 ;
    ceterms:subjectWebpage <https://www.ctc.ca.gov/credentials/leaflets/cl-879/> .

