_:c14n476
    a ceterms:ConditionProfile ;
    ceterms:condition "A degree major in liberal studies or 40 semester units including 10 semester units of course work in each of at least four of the following subject areas or at least 10 semester units of course work in each of three of the subject areas and an additional 10 semester units in a combination of two of the remaining subject areas.† Subject areas include language studies, history, literature, humanities, mathematics, the arts, science, physical education, social science, and human development."@en-us,
        "Passage of the appropriate subject matter examinations for the Multiple Subject Credential may also be used to meet this requirement."@en-us ;
    ceterms:name "Multiple Subject:"@en-us ;
    ceterms:subjectWebpage <https://www.ctc.ca.gov/credentials/leaflets/cl-858/> .

